      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The neighborhood’s name comes from Matthias Baldwin Park, a centrally located green space.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spring_Garden%2C_Philadelphia",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In the early 1800s, the area was subdivided and brick and brownstone townhouses were built, many in Italianate and Queen Anne styles.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6,
        21,
        22
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
