      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spring_Garden%2C_Philadelphia",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Spring Garden station, refurbished in 2011, sits at the intersection of Broad and Spring Garden Streets and connects the neighborhood to the city’s transit network.",
